{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550130/extras/Description_1.png?t=1744724430\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailless Frank is a randomly generated roguelite deckbuilding game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Frank on his journey by exploring the caves, upgrading your deck and fighting enemies to find what happened to his tail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will let you play through one of the three areas and experience a few of the enemies, cards and special items available in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deck Building: find the merchants, choose your cards wisely and combine them to fight the enemies. Watch out for cards that hurt you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is unique: with random generated maps, every run will feel different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special items: powerful items that will enhance your deck and your abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your deck to fight the enemies. Look for special items that help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550130/extras/Description_3.png?t=1744724430\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Merchant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The merchant will give you an opportunity to edit your deck by buying new cards and abilities that will enhance them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550130/extras/Description_2.png?t=1744724430\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550130?t=1744724430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite